  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">SSC JHT Paper-II Result 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-04T13:19:52+05:30\">June 4, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">1:19 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Staff Selection Commission (SSC),</strong></a> </span>has released the<strong> Paper-II Result </strong>on its&nbsp;<strong>official website</strong> for the Recruitment of <strong>Junior Hindi Translator, Hindi Translator, Senior Translator &amp; Hindi Pradhyapak CHT Examination 2025.</strong> The exam was conducted on<strong> 14 December 2025</strong>, and the last date to submit the application form was&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"230\" data-end=\"250\">26 June 2025</strong>. Candidates can check their&nbsp;<strong>Paper-II Result</strong>&nbsp;using&nbsp;their&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"362\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>&nbsp;by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- Wha