"font-size: 14pt;\">CHTE Paper-II Exam Date :<strong> 14 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Paper-II Exam City Details : <strong>04 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Paper-II Admit Card : <strong>12 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Paper-II Result : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>04 June 2026 Available Now</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <strong>SSC</strong> official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For<strong> General/ OBC/ EWS </strong>: <strong>₹ 100/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>SC/ ST/ Female</strong>&nbsp;: <strong>₹ 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>PH Candidates</strong> : <strong>₹ 0/-</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">SSC JHT, JT, CHT Notification 2025 : Age Limits As On 01 August 2025</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>27 Years.&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>30 Years&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SSC</strong> provides age relaxation for the<strong> SSC JHT, JT, CHT </strong>position as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">457 Posts</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">SSC JHT, JT, CHT Recruitment 2025 : Vacancy Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 100px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 18.8522%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.3173%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>No. Of Post</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.8304%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 18.8522%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Junior Hindi Translator (JHT) &amp; Senior Hindi Translator (SHT)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.3173%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">457</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.8304%; height: 25px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a Master’s degree in Hindi or English with the other as a compulsory subject, or a Master’s in any subject with English medium and Hindi as a compulsory subject at the graduation level. Additionally, they should have a recognized translation diploma or 2 years of translation experience.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</span></strong> <strong><a class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__post-title\" href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/bihar-shs-ayush-medical-officer-recruitment-2025-start/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bihar SHS Ayush Medical Officer Recruitment 2025</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download SSC JHT Paper-II Result 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"130\" data-end=\"195\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Visit the <strong data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"173\">official SSC regional website</strong> based on your zone.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"198\" data-end=\"289\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">On the homepage, click on the section labeled <strong data-start=\"244\" data-end=\"286\">“Candidate Login / Application Status”</strong>.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"292\" data-end=\"375\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Search for the link <strong data-start=\"312\" data-end=\"372\">“SSC JHT Paper-II Result 2026”</strong>.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"451\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Enter your <strong data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"426\">Registration Number / Roll Number</strong> and <strong data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"448\">Date of Birth</strong>.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"494\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Fill the <strong data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"479\">Captcha Code</strong> if required.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"546\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on the <strong data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"536\">Submit / Search Status</strong> button.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"631\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Your <strong data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"602\">Result</strong> will appear on the screen.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"687\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Download or <strong data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"665\">take a printout</strong> for future reference.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;SSC JHT, JT, CHT Recruitment 2025 : </span>Mode Of Selection&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><b>CBT</b><b><br>\n</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-si